# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

shapes is project
shapes purpose "Compute areas of shapes held in enums and records, with an error enum of their own; a stage0 sample both runs agree on"
shapes target console
shapes version "0.1.0"
shapes language refined 1
shapes standardLibrary 1
shapes allows write console.stdout none
shapes requires none
shapes includesModule shapes
shapes entry shapes.main
